,"target":{"mode":"bridge","ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","kind":"node-class","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"key":"person","label":"Person"},"resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"],"bridge":{"ref":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","resourceKind":"node-class","scope":"focused-graph","grants":["create"]},"_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","targetKind":"node-class","classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"}}},{"id":"laura-loomer-detail","type":"port","label":"Laura Loomer","position":{"x":0,"y":-900},"width":720,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph","portId":"root","name":"Laura Loomer"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Laura Loomer"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 👤 Laura Loomer\n\n![Portrait of Laura Loomer](https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Laura_Loomer_%2853460281685%29.jpg)\n\n**political activist · media personality · podcast host**\n\nAmerican political activist and media personality known for provocative right-wing activism, online commentary, and involvement in Donald Trump's political orbit.\n\n*Photo: Gage Skidmore, 10 Jan 2024, Wikimedia Commons.*"}},{"id":"laura-loomer-person","type":"person","label":"Laura Loomer","position":{"x":0,"y":-300},"width":500,"height":340,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"displayName":"Laura Loomer","fullName":"Laura Elizabeth Loomer","aliases":[],"summary":"American political activist and media personality known for provocative right-wing activism, online commentary, and involvement in Donald Trump's political orbit.","portrait":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Laura_Loomer_%2853460281685%29.jpg","birthDate":"1993-05-21","deathDate":"","pronouns":"","nationality":"American","primaryRoles":["political activist","media personality","podcast host","former congressional candidate"],"canonicalUri":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/laura-loomer.node","status":"published","definitionKey":"person","_classBinding":{"key":"person","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"person","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/people/template/person.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"}}},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-1","type":"markdown","label":"Background","position":{"x":-900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Background\n\nLaura Loomer was born in 1993 and grew up in Arizona. She graduated from Barry University in Florida in 2015 with a degree in broadcast journalism and a minor in political science, according to her congressional campaign biography. Early in her career she worked with Project Veritas and became known for confrontational, stunt-oriented political activism and online reporting."}},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-2","type":"markdown","label":"Political and media career","position":{"x":0,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Political and media career\n\nLoomer has run for the U.S. House of Representatives in Florida and built a large online audience around political commentary, investigations, livestreams, and her *Loomer Unleashed* program. Reuters reported in 2025 that she had become an influential voice in the MAGA movement despite holding no formal administration role, with access to Donald Trump and a reputation for publicly pressuring officials and appointees."}},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-3","type":"markdown","label":"Public controversy and positioning","position":{"x":900,"y":180},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Public controversy and positioning\n\nAssociated Press profiles Loomer as a far-right activist whose career has included inflammatory anti-Muslim rhetoric, conspiracy claims, and repeated platform bans or restrictions. Her prominence comes partly from the same confrontational style that has generated sustained criticism. This graph records those descriptions as sourced public-history context rather than adopting her claims or her critics' judgments."}},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-4","type":"markdown","label":"Lionel episode context","position":{"x":-450,"y":650},"width":700,"height":380,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Lionel episode context\n\nIn Lionel Template v1 Example 01, Loomer appears inside the Actor Field as one of the figures Lionel uses to reason about political realignment. Her presence in that graph is structural: she is treated as a named actor whose loyalties, criticism, and influence are discussed by Lionel, not as an independently verified explanation for the episode's claims."}},{"id":"laura-loomer-sources","type":"markdown","label":"Sources","position":{"x":0,"y":1150},"width":900,"height":520,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"laura-loomer-person-graph"},"markdown":"## Sources and photo provenance\n\n- **Reuters**, *Laura Loomer swipes at Trump from the heart of MAGA*  \n  https://www.reuters.com/world/us/laura-loomer-swipes-trump-heart-maga-2025-05-20/\n- **Associated Press**, *A look at Laura Loomer, longtime Trump ally criticized for racist posts and Sept. 11 conspiracies*  \n  https://apnews.com/article/f7bc493ae99014362875e5d390769477\n- **Laura Loomer for Congress**, *Meet Laura Loomer*  \n  https://lauraloomerforcongress.com/about/\n- **Wikimedia Commons**, *Laura Loomer (53460281685).jpg*  \n  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Laura_Loomer_(53460281685).jpg\n\n**Portrait URL:** https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Laura_Loomer_%2853460281685%29.jpg\n**Photo note:** Photo: Gage Skidmore, 10 Jan 2024, Wikimedia Commons.\n\n**Lionel context:** `github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/example-01-associative-realignment.node`"}}],"edges":[{"id":"laura-loomer-section-edge-1","source":"laura-loomer-person","target":"laura-loomer-section-1","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-edge-2","source":"laura-loomer-person","target":"laura-loomer-section-2","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-edge-3","source":"laura-loomer-person","target":"laura-loomer-section-3","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"laura-loomer-section-edge-4","source":"laura-loomer-person","target":"laura-loomer-section-4","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile context"},{"id":"laura-loomer-class","source":"laura-loomer-declaration","target":"laura-loomer-person-bridge","sourceHandle":"root","targetHandle":"root","type":"reference","label":"class authority"},{"id":"laura-loomer-inst","source":"laura-loomer-person-bridge","target":"laura-loomer-person","sourceHandle":"root","targetHandle":"root","type":"reference","label":"instantiates"},{"id":"laura-loomer-profile","source":"laura-loomer-detail","target":"laura-loomer-person","sourceHandle":"root","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"profile"},{"id":"laura-loomer-source","source":"laura-loomer-person","target":"laura-loomer-sources","sourceHandle":"bottom","targetHandle":"top","type":"reference","label":"sourced by"}],"clusters":[],"settings":{"theme":null,"backgroundImage":null,"defaultNodeColor":"#1976d2","defaultEdgeColor":"#666666","snapToGrid":false,"gridSize":20,"edgeRouting":"auto","autoSave":false},"scripts":[]}